sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Owner
  participant Portal
  participant D1
  participant Reminders
  participant Resend
  participant Zoho_info
  participant Twilio
  participant Patient

  Owner->>Portal: Confirm + exact Ireland start
  Portal->>D1: status confirmed, remind_at = 09:00 day before

  alt Still time (before day-before 09:00)
    Portal->>Resend: Appointment confirmed + invite.ics
    Resend->>Patient: Confirmation email + calendar invite
    Resend->>Zoho_info: Cc plus clinic copy (same UID)
    opt Patient SMS On and opted in
      Portal->>Twilio: Same text SMS
      Twilio->>Patient: SMS
    end
    Note over Reminders: Cron every 15 min (email only, no ICS)
    Reminders->>D1: confirmed where remind_at is due
    Reminders->>Resend: Reminder for tomorrow
    Resend->>Patient: Reminder email
    opt Patient SMS On and opted in
      Reminders->>Twilio: Same text SMS
      Twilio->>Patient: SMS
    end
  else Last minute (day before after 09:00, or same day)
    Portal->>Resend: Confirmed, see you then + invite.ics
    Resend->>Patient: Combined email + calendar invite
    Resend->>Zoho_info: Cc plus clinic copy (same UID)
    opt Patient SMS On and opted in
      Portal->>Twilio: Same text SMS
      Twilio->>Patient: SMS
    end
  end
